{{#is_alert}}
A share of {{value}} of the flow runs that finished on the Prefect server in the last hour ended in a Failed state (`prefect.server.flow_runs.failed.count`). Review recent failed runs for a common error, such as an infrastructure, credential, or upstream dependency problem.
{{/is_alert}}

